WEBVTT

00:00:12.483 --> 00:00:14.180
HERMIONE: It had to be
a Gryffindor.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.966
Nobody else knows
our password.

00:00:16.966 --> 00:00:19.620
Unless it wasn't
a student.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.100
Whoever it was,

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.494
they must've been
looking for something.

00:00:23.494 --> 00:00:24.538
And they found it.

00:00:24.538 --> 00:00:27.715
Tom Riddle's diary is gone.

00:00:29.239 --> 00:00:30.631
'All right, listen up.

00:00:30.631 --> 00:00:32.111
We play our game,

00:00:32.111 --> 00:00:33.765
Hufflepuff
doesn't stand a chance.

00:00:33.765 --> 00:00:35.941
We're stronger, quicker
and smarter.

00:00:35.941 --> 00:00:38.030
And not to mention,
they're dead scared

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:41.120
that Harry'll Petrify them
if they fly anywhere near him.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.340
Well, that too.

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.994
Professor McGonagall.

00:00:44.994 --> 00:00:47.300
This match
has been canceled.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.259
They can't cancel Quidditch.

00:00:49.259 --> 00:00:50.825
Silence, Wood.

00:00:50.825 --> 00:00:52.697
You and your teammates
will go to Gryffindor Tower.

00:00:52.697 --> 00:00:54.655
Now.

00:00:54.655 --> 00:00:56.657
Potter, you and I
will find Mr. Weasley.

00:00:56.657 --> 00:00:59.399
There's something
the both of you have to see.

00:01:01.575 --> 00:01:04.883
I warn you. This could be
a wee bit of a shock.

00:01:13.892 --> 00:01:15.198
Hermione...

00:01:15.198 --> 00:01:16.677
She was found
near the library...

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:21.204
along with this.

00:01:21.204 --> 00:01:24.424
Does it mean anything
to either of you?

00:01:24.424 --> 00:01:26.992
No.

00:01:40.136 --> 00:01:42.616
Could I have
your attention, please?

00:01:42.616 --> 00:01:45.880
Because of recent events,
these new rules

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:48.622
will be put into effect
immediately:

00:01:48.622 --> 00:01:51.016
"All students will return
to their house common rooms

00:01:51.016 --> 00:01:53.758
"by 6:00 every evening.

00:01:53.758 --> 00:01:55.368
"All students

00:01:55.368 --> 00:01:56.848
"will be escorted
to each lesson

00:01:56.848 --> 00:01:58.371
"by a teacher.

00:01:58.371 --> 00:01:59.807
No exceptions."

00:02:01.374 --> 00:02:03.376
I should tell you this.

00:02:03.376 --> 00:02:08.729
Unless the culprit behind
these attacks is caught...

00:02:08.729 --> 00:02:11.080
it is likely
the school will be closed.

00:02:14.648 --> 00:02:17.086
[CHILDREN WHISPERING]

00:02:23.396 --> 00:02:25.224
We've got to talk
to Hagrid, Ron.

00:02:25.224 --> 00:02:26.878
I can't believe it's him,

00:02:26.878 --> 00:02:29.141
but if he did
set the monster loose last time,

00:02:29.141 --> 00:02:31.100
he'll know how to get inside
the Chamber of Secrets,

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:32.318
and that's a start.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.972
But you heard McGonagall.

00:02:33.972 --> 00:02:36.018
We're not allowed to leave
the tower except for class.

00:02:37.628 --> 00:02:40.065
I think it's time to get
my dad's old cloak out again.

00:02:40.065 --> 00:02:42.154
[♪♪♪]

00:02:45.592 --> 00:02:47.159
[KNOCKING]

